---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Podcasts
permalink: /podcast/
description: Long-form conversation from EGregoRA — cosmology, druidry, neuroscience and the esoteric, argued at length.
---

<section class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">Voices in the Grove</p>
  <h1>Podcasts</h1>
  <p class="lede muted">Long-form conversation. No hurry, no hedging, no selling.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame">
    <p>Each episode is one question followed as far as it will go — usually an hour, sometimes two. Edward hosts;
    guests arrive from observatories, woodlands, laboratories, temples and occasionally the pub. Subscribe wherever
    you keep your feeds, or play episodes directly below.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href="/feed.xml">RSS Feed</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#episodes">Browse Episodes</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider">✦</div>

{%- set amLast = 0 -%}
{%- for ep in episodes -%}
  {%- set n = ep.number | int -%}
  {%- if n > amLast %}{% set amLast = n %}{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{% set dsKind = "audio" %}
{% include "partials/device-studio.njk" %}

<div class="divider">✦</div>

{% set amKind = "audio" %}{% set amNoun = "an episode" %}{% set amIt = "it" %}{% set amAfter = amLast %}
{% include "partials/admin-media.njk" %}

<div class="divider">✦</div>

<section class="wrap" id="episodes">
  <div class="media-list" id="uploaded-media" data-kind="audio" hidden></div>
  <div class="media-list">
    {% for ep in episodes | reverse %}
    <details class="frame media ep reveal">
      <summary>
        <span class="num">{{ ep.number }}</span>
        <span class="ep-head">
          <span class="meta">{{ ep.date }} · {{ ep.duration }}</span>
          <span class="ep-title">{{ ep.title }}</span>
          <span class="muted xsmall">{{ ep.tags | join(" · ") }}</span>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="ep-body">
        <p>{{ ep.summary }}</p>
        {% if ep.links and ep.links.length %}
        <p class="kicker">Where it meets the rest of the house</p>
        <ul class="am-links">
          {%- for l in ep.links %}
          <li><a href="{{ l.href }}">{{ l.title }}</a> <span class="muted xsmall">{{ l.why }}</span></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% endif %}
        {% if ep.audio %}
          <audio class="player" controls preload="none" src="{{ ep.audio }}"></audio>
        {% else %}
          <p class="muted pending">⟡ Audio upload pending.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <div class="upload-note">
      <strong>For Ed — how to publish a new episode.</strong>
      Drop the MP3 into <code>src/assets/audio/</code>, then add an entry at the end of
      <code>src/_data/episodes.json</code>:
      <pre class="code-block">{ "number": "004", "title": "…", "date": "2026-10-17", "duration": "1h 04m",
  "summary": "…", "audio": "/assets/audio/ep004.mp3", "tags": ["astronomy"] }</pre>
      Commit and push — the site rebuilds with the episode and the RSS feed in place. External hosts (Acast,
      Captivate, Spotify) work too: put their direct MP3 URL in <code>audio</code>.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/assets/js/player.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/freeai-admin.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/media-admin.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/device-studio.js?v={{ build.id }}"></script>
